# Settings › Home server › Drives & undo (docs/HOME-SERVER.md): takes the snapshots that are due, drops the ones past
# their keep counts and empties recycle-bin files older than 30 days. Started only by its timer, which is off until
# you turn snapshots (or a share's recycle bin) on; with Light mode on it waits while you play. Lowest CPU and disk
# priority, and nothing waits for it: it's never part of starting the PC, the session or Game Mode.
[Unit]
Description=Hearth home server: snapshots and recycle bins
ConditionPathExists=/etc/hearth/home-server.json
After=local-fs.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/libexec/nimbus/hearth-home-server-helper snapshot run
Nice=19
CPUSchedulingPolicy=idle
IOSchedulingClass=idle
TimeoutStartSec=30min
